title: PerformanceReview
---
<<get_total_score "YarnManager">>
A figure steps into the room. Their presence is suffocatingly calm.
Reviewer: Your shift has concluded, Arbiter.
Reviewer: Let us review your performance.
<<if $totalScore >= $maxScore * 0.75>>
    Reviewer: You have performed well.
<<elseif $totalScore >= $maxScore * 0.4>>
    Reviewer: Your performance was... acceptable.
<<else>>
    Reviewer: Your performance is deeply concerning.
<<endif>>
-> Continue
    <<jump PerformanceReview_Mary>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_Mary
---
<<get_subject_breakdown "YarnManager" "MaryGonzalez">>

Reviewer: Subject: Mary Gonzalez.
<<if not $nameCorrect>>
    Reviewer: You failed to correctly record her identity.
<<endif>>
<<if not $occupationCorrect>>
    Reviewer: You misrepresented her occupation.
<<endif>>
<<if not $loyaltyCorrect>>
    Reviewer: Your loyalty assessment was flawed.
    Reviewer: She expressed sentiments bordering on ideological deviation.
<<endif>>
<<if $subjectScore == $subjectMax>>
    Reviewer: A precise and efficient evaluation.
<<elseif $subjectScore > ($subjectMax / 2)>>
    Reviewer: Some errors, but nothing catastrophic.
<<else>>
    Reviewer: This report is unreliable.
<<endif>>
-> Continue
    <<jump PerformanceReview_Eethin>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_Eethin
---
<<get_subject_breakdown "YarnManager" "EethinMiller">>
Reviewer: Subject: Eethin Roosevelt Miller.
<<if not $nameCorrect>>
    Reviewer: You filled out his name wrong, in part because you interrupted his spelling.
    Reviewer: You should know how common a spelling 'EE-thin' is. 
<<endif>>
<<if not $occupationCorrect>>
    Reviewer: His position within the Compliance structure was incorrectly recorded.
    Reviewer: Given his evasive answer, we can forgive this. 
<<endif>>
<<if not $loyaltyCorrect>>
    Reviewer: You underrestimated his loyalty.
    Reviewer: The Republic should seek to uplift devoted youths like him. 
<<endif>>
<<if $subjectScore == $subjectMax>>
    Reviewer: A flawless assessment.
<<elseif $subjectScore > ($subjectMax / 2)>>
    Reviewer: Your results are adequate.
<<else>>
    Reviewer: A complete failure in judgment. Your betters [b]will[/b] hear of this.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 10>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    Force: [Fo]Damn.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
-> (Final Evaluation)
    <<jump PerformanceReview_Final>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_Final
---
<<get_total_score "YarnManager">>
Reviewer: Here's the results overall:
<<if $totalScore >= $maxScore * 0.85>>
    Reviewer: I rarely say this, but I'm impressed.
    Reviewer: Continue in this manner, and the Republic will reward you greatly for your service.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 12>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        Force: [Fo]Boosh.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $totalScore >= $maxScore * 0.5>>
    Reviewer: Your performance was... adequate. 
    Reviewer: We expect improvement.
<<else>>
    Reviewer: Your performance was lacking.
    Reviewer: Keep in mind there are many 'Eethins' out there jumping to take your place.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 12>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        Force: [Fo]If I were more than just a fragment of your psyche and had a physical form, I'd be shitting my physical pants.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
Reviewer: That will be all for today. We'll see you tomorrow.
-> End Day

<<end_day "YarnManager" "END">>
===